[TABLE from plants_and_fruits.pdf, Page 3]
Plant Organ | Primary Function | Example
Roots | Absorption, anchorage, storage | Carrot (taproot)
Stems | Support, transport, storage | Sugarcane (stores sugar)
Leaves | Photosynthesis, gas exchange | Spinach, Mint
Flowers | Reproduction, pollination | Rose, Sunflower
Fruits | Seed dispersal, nutrition | Mango, Apple
Seeds | Plant reproduction | Wheat, R